 "caption": "Gifford et al. 2014 Lab Chip 14, 4496\u20134505, Fig. 4 inset (the 300 \u00b5m bar, 107.52 px; the legs at 45.78\u00b0 on the image, from the post columns) with gifford2014_fig4_design: leg 4's last post rows and the leads beyond (cyan: the reproduction claim), and the neighbouring leg at the preset's leg spacing, read on this inset (amber: its centre line is the image's by construction; its side channels' widths there depend on which of its rows pass the inset, which the inset does not fix).  Registration: scale from the bar, rotation measured on the image; translation fitted on features and, independently, by chamfer matching (they agree within 0.1 / 0.0 px along / across).  Nearest-outline offset: median 1.21 \u00b5m, 90th percentile 18.17 \u00b5m (n 7054); for comparison 4.12 \u00b5m with the mask shifted half a pitch along and 4.82 \u00b5m with it shifted 5 \u00b5m across.  On the image: leg 4's post columns 159.2 \u00b5m apart (mask w_c + l_g = 159.5), pitch 45.83 / 45.84 \u00b5m (mask 45.8); the legs' centrelines 818 \u00b5m apart (mask 818).",
